# FABLE-SONNET-SEND-IN-METHODS-20260925-168 commit 2: `sendMessage: X` inside a method body --
# a direct native call of the same generated sender the root's own walker step calls. A method
# called from the root sends exit(exit_code: 7; ...) to the host, which reports 7.
fn: send_exit () int
    sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
    return: 0
end: send_exit

send_exit()
return
